  "details": "15165 `Click to prioritize downloading avatars from friends.`\n\nis tooltip string for MM > Settings > Avatar > Avatar Download Prioritization\n\nIt is used in both the on and off states of the option, so the `Click to` part is wrong as an explanation.\n\nThis issue is written on Crowdin comment as an issue. Please mark it resolved when this post is fixed.\n\n---\n\n(edit) Also\n\n15167 `Click to prioritize downloading avatars from users you've manually shown.`\n\nhas the identical issue. It appears as the tooltip of the above option (that is, the 2nd option of this section).",
